      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَحَالِفُ</span></b>  a pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُحْلُوفَةٌ</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُمُرٌ زَحَالِفُ الصُّقْلِ</span>
<i>Asses having smooth and fat bellies.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>Small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَوَابّ</span> [i. e. <i>reptiles,</i> or
